cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and link the repository or the study you used."
type: dataset
title: "AI Search Landscape: an open, sourced dataset of AI search optimization and AI agent companies"
abstract: >-
  The structured dataset behind two Growth Of Influence studies: 151 AI search
  optimization (GEO and AEO) companies and 437 AI agent products from 420
  companies, October 2026 editions. One record per company with headquarters,
  founded year, disclosed funding, acquisitions and listed prices, each figure
  with a source URL.
